# Input bindings: one 'bind <action> <input>' per line. An action can have many.
# Names are listed in docs/InputSchema.md. Edit here or in the editor (Window > Input).
shockwave_input 1
deadzone 0.15

bind pulse key Space
bind pulse pad south

# Flight sticks, wheels and pedals bind by part of their name (see `player --devices`):
# bind pulse joy "T.16000M" button 0
# bind throttle joy "TWCS" axis 2 full invert
# bind steer_right joy "G29" axis 0 +
